OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMortuary failings raised risk of
OL,4,Abody mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrieving families may have been at risk
OL,7,Fof being shown the wrong body at a
OL,8,FSussex hospital mortuary, inspectors
OL,9,Fhave found.
OL,11,FA report by The Human Tissue Authority
OL,12,F(HTA) found identification procedures
OL,13,Fwere not being followed consistently at
OL,14,FWorthing Hospital, where regulators
OL,15,Falso uncovered a number of security and
OL,16,Fdignity concerns, including bodies
OL,17,Fbeing visible from a public footpath.
OL,19,FA near miss involving body
OL,20,Fidentification was only discovered
OL,21,Fafter staff spotted an unrelated
OL,22,Fdiscrepancy, the report said.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
