OL,3,GNEWSAMortuary failings raised risk of
OL,4,Abody mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex said it had
OL,7,Fmade "immediate improvements to
OL,8,Fstrengthen security and privacy" and
OL,9,Fthat most issues identified during the
OL,10,Finspection had already been addressed.
